> all the scrolls with the same name in the inventory have the same effect? 

Yes and no.

The scrolls have a class name like 'ELBIB YLOH', 'KIRJE' or 'ZELGO MER'. 
These names are suffled when you start a new game. So in one game ELBIB 
YLOH might be identification, the next it might be enchant armor and so on.

The BUC-status also might affect the workings of the scroll. Blessed 
scrolls usually do more than uncursed ones and cursed scrolls can have 
even the opposite effect.

If you want to be totally spoiled you can read these two spoilers

http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/343/scrl-343.txt

